"Step editing mode" = "步骤编辑方式";
"Visual steps" = "可视化步骤";
"Rule text" = "规则文本";
"Rule text has unapplied changes. Return to Rule text to apply or discard them before saving." = "规则文本有尚未应用的修改。请返回规则文本应用或放弃这些修改后再保存。";
"Reload rule text from visual steps?" = "根据可视化步骤重新生成规则文本？";
"Discard rule text and reload" = "放弃文本修改并重新生成";
"Cancel" = "取消";
"This replaces the unapplied rule text for this workflow. Its visual steps stay unchanged." = "这会替换此工作流尚未应用的规则文本，可视化步骤保持不变。";
"Replace the changed visual steps?" = "替换已修改的可视化步骤？";
"Apply rule text" = "应用规则文本";
"Visual steps changed after this rule draft was created. Applying valid rule text replaces those visual edits." = "生成这份规则草稿后，可视化步骤又发生了修改。应用有效的规则文本会替换这些步骤修改。";
"Clipy rules use indentation and if/else blocks. This is not Python: only the actions and conditions listed below are accepted." = "Clipy 规则使用缩进和 if/else 条件块，仅支持下方列出的动作与条件，不能执行任意 Python 代码。";
"Workflow rule text" = "工作流规则文本";
"Checking rule text…" = "正在检查规则文本…";
"Line %lld, column %lld: %@" = "第 %lld 行，第 %lld 列：%@";
"Go to error" = "转到错误位置";
"Visual steps changed while this rule text was pending. Applying it will replace those visual edits." = "这份规则文本尚未应用，可视化步骤又发生了修改。应用文本会替换这些步骤修改。";
"Reload from visual steps" = "从可视化步骤重新生成";
"Applied to visual steps" = "已应用到可视化步骤";
"Unapplied rule text" = "规则文本尚未应用";
"Rule syntax reference" = "规则语法说明";
"Use four spaces per indentation level. Tab inserts four spaces, and Return continues the current indentation." = "每层缩进使用四个空格。Tab 键插入四个空格，回车键延续当前缩进。";
"Conditions can combine is_text(), is_image(), contains(\"text\") and matches(\"pattern\") with and, or, not and parentheses." = "可用 and、or、not 和括号组合 is_text()、is_image()、contains(\"text\") 和 matches(\"pattern\") 条件。";
"Actions use stable English names, even when Clipy’s interface language changes. Wrap steps in a disabled: block to keep them without running them; use pass for an empty branch." = "切换 Clipy 界面语言不会改变动作的英文名称。把步骤放入 disabled: 块可保留但不运行；空分支使用 pass。";
"A require_text(), require_image(), require_contains(\"text\") or require_matches(\"pattern\") guard stops the workflow when it does not match. Use an if block to choose between branches instead." = "require_text()、require_image()、require_contains(\"text\") 和 require_matches(\"pattern\") 在条件不匹配时终止工作流。如果需要执行不同分支，请使用 if 块。";
"Rule text could not be prepared. Try again." = "未能生成规则文本，请重试。";
"Rule text could not be applied. Try again." = "未能应用规则文本，请重试。";
